SUMMARY:Advent of Code Sharing Session - R-Ladies PDX
DESCRIPTION:We'll be sharing our solutions to Advent of Code https://adventofcode.com this year - you are welcome to do one or more of the puzzles and share your solution or attempt at the event or hang out and see how others have solved things!\n\nMany of us have never participated in Advent of Code before, so some things to know:\n\- they start Dec 1\n\- the puzzles increase in difficulty each day\n\- they are designed to be solved in the programming language of your choice \- we suggest R of course\, but would love to see other solutions if that's what you want to do\!
LOCATION:Lucky Labrador Public House, 7675 SW Capitol Hwy, Portland, OR 97219, USA, Portland, UNITED STATES OF AMERICA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-pdx/events/317475568/
