SUMMARY:Hacking GenAI usage amongst Hackathon goers in a Hackathon (aka Hack-ception) - R-Ladies Philly
DESCRIPTION:Hackathons have always been a place of chaos, trials, and big dreams. Even more so, it has been proven time and again to be a fantastic tool for learning through implementation. How has this changed with the rapid increase in using AI? What does cross-checking and validation of a generated output look like? Using R for data analysis, we studied how, when, and why participants used generative AI tools in their projects at the BioIT hackathon earlier this year. This talk shares what we observed and learned.
LOCATION:Online event
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-philly/events/317373503/
ORGANIZER;CN=R-Ladies Philly:mailto:info@rladies.org
CATEGORIES:RLadies+,R-Ladies Philly
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENTBEGIN:VEVENT
