SUMMARY:Project Clinic and Coworking - RLadies+ Vienna
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by some interesting experience sharing during our previous events, we are organizing a **coworking** session on R programming. You're welcome to stay for the entire 2-hour session, or as long as you need within the duration. We will:\n\n* Cowork independently on R-related projects or tasks\n* Ask questions, if any, and exchange ideas and experience\n* Meet other R users in Vienna and our host, Laura\n\nInstead of working alone at a screen, we would like to trial this event format to bring our community together, and learn from each other through actual human experiences.\n\nAs we promote gender diversity and inclusion in the R community, all gender identities and skill levels in R are welcome!\n\n**💡 What to bring**\n\n* Your laptop\n* An R project or task you would like to work on\n* (Optional) Questions regarding R programming\n\n**🗺️ Location**\nSeminarraum AE EG - 1 (AEEG25)\nGround Floor\nKarlsplatz 13\n1040 Vienna\n\n**📍 How to find us**\nAfter entering the main entrance of the TU Wien main building at Karlsplatz, turn left and walk along the corridor. The seminar room will be on your left.\nUse this [floor plan](https://maps.tuwien.ac.at/?q=AEEG25#map) to help locate the room.
LOCATION:TU Wien, Karlsplatz 13, 1040 Wien, Austria, Wien, AUSTRIA
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-vienna/events/317289714/
