SUMMARY:Examining the 2026 municipal election results using R and Open Ottawa data - R-Ladies Ottawa
DESCRIPTION:Open Ottawa has a great collection of data that is open to the public! We'll be exploring the 2026 municipal elections official results using R and RStudio.\n\nWe'll walk through:\n\n* importing the data\n* clean the data\n* do a preliminary exploration of the data\n* come out with some nice graphs!\n\nIf you want to code along, make sure you have the following:\n\n* R\n* RStudio\n\nAnd we'll go over installing the relevant packages during the demo. You can find the repository for the code-along [here](https://github.com/RLadies-Ottawa/2026-11-23_open-data-ottawa_2026-municipal-elections).\n\nZoom link will be provided to attendees prior to the event.
